SUMMARY:Teen Polymer Clay Ring Making Class: Create with Phoebe- Please Register
DESCRIPTION:\n\nDesign and create your own custom statement rings using 
 colorful polymer clay! In this hands-on workshop\, teens will learn simple 
 techniques to craft bold\, modern designs that reflect their personal style 
 before their creations are baked on-site and assembled into wearable rings 
 to take home. No experience necessary—all materials are provided\, just 
 bring your creativity! Open to Anyone entering Grades 6 - 12.
LOCATION:West Orange - Program Room
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10341-17232049
