SUMMARY:Your Next Career Chapter: Practical Tools for Today's Job Search
DESCRIPTION:An AARP Community Workshop\n\n\n\nLooking for guidance in a 
 career transition? Learn how to age-proof your resume\, use AI in your job 
 search\, network effectively\, and hone your interviewing skills.\n\nJoin 
 the AARP for this free\, interactive workshop where you can: \n\n\n	Connect 
 with fellow job seekers \n	Get tips to help strengthen your resume  
 \n	Explore how to optimize your online presence \n	Prepare for tough 
 interview questions \n	And more! \n\n\nOpen to all adult job seekers and 
 anyone curious about how AI is affecting the job market.\n\nRegistration is 
 required through the AARP website: Register here
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Technology
UID:LibCal-10341-17106578
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17106578
END:VEVENT
