SUMMARY:Tech Talk
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Tech Talk. We offer the following:\n\n\n	2-hour 
 NorthStar Digital Literacy class\n	Assistance with your computer\, 
 smartphone\, tablet\, or other device\n	20-minute private sessions with 
 tech instructors\n\n\nPlease call the Reference Desk to make your 
 appointment: (973) 736-0196\n\nThis class meets in the Community Room while 
 the lower level is repaired. Unfortunately\, computer access is limited.
LOCATION:West Orange - Computer Lab
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Technology
