DTSTART:20270823T220000Z
DTEND:20270823T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20270823T000000Z
SUMMARY:Rosetta Stone Language Lab
DESCRIPTION:Learn a new language with Rosetta Stone! \n\nThis award-winning 
 language learning software is available for free with your library card. 
 Find a program specifically tailored to your learning style and strengthen 
 your language skills for travel\, work\, or fun.
LOCATION:West Orange - Computer Lab
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10341-17318173
